00F8                  (            os9.d):01319         E$Full              RMB       1                   Media Full
00F9                  (            os9.d):01320         E$BTyp              RMB       1                   Bad Type (incompatable) media
00FA                  (            os9.d):01321         E$DevBsy            RMB       1                   Device Busy
00FB                  (            os9.d):01322         E$DIDC              RMB       1                   Disk ID Change
00FC                  (            os9.d):01323         E$Lock              RMB       1                   Record is busy (locked out)
00FD                  (            os9.d):01324         E$Share             RMB       1                   Non-sharable file busy
00FE                  (            os9.d):01325         E$DeadLk            RMB       1                   I/O Deadlock error
