                      (           coco.d):00011         * Added defs by Bruce Isted from his Eliminator archive.
                      (           coco.d):00012         *
                      (           coco.d):00013         *          1998/10/31  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (           coco.d):00014         * Merged cc3global.defs into this file.
                      (           coco.d):00015         *
                      (           coco.d):00016         *          2002/04/30  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (           coco.d):00017         * Merged Level One and Level Two sysdefs.
                      (           coco.d):00018         *
                      (           coco.d):00019         *          2002/06/22  Boisy G. Pitre
                      (           coco.d):00020         * Removed PIA.U4 and PIA.U8, improved comments
                      (           coco.d):00021         *
                      (           coco.d):00022         *          2003/11/05  Robert Gault
                      (           coco.d):00023         * Made changes in window globals and grfdrv memory to handle regW
                      (           coco.d):00024         * in 6809 systems.
                      (           coco.d):00025         *
                      (           coco.d):00026         *          2003/11/30  Boisy G. Pitre
